  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original genus-level whole organism. Choose better-known Q.lawsoni; retain long straight neck, huge pointed beak, tall walking limbs, folded wings. Not isolated skull or giant Q.northropi. [\"Soft tissue, membrane attachment/outline, skin colour and static pose are inferred.\", \"Do not reproduce bone openings as holes in living flesh.\", \"Folded pose height/length are artistic proportions, not measured holotype;4.5m is unfolded span reference.\"] {\"unfolded_wingspan_m\": 4.5, \"basis\": \"Andres/Langston2021 p47 and diagnosis; species estimate not pose bounding-box width. Reject mixing10m Q.northropi or18–20ft press number.\", \"constructed_extended_wing_path_m\": 4.480847806543123, \"constructed_path_note\": \"Approximate straightened sum of shoulder-to-wrist plus single fourth-finger control-path lengths and 0.28 m shoulder spacing. Close to 4.5 m reference, not a fossil measurement or folded bounding box.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original genus-level whole organism. Choose better-known Q.lawsoni; retain long straight neck, huge pointed beak, tall walking limbs, folded wings. Not isolated skull or giant Q.northropi. [\"Soft tissue, membrane attachment/outline, skin colour and static pose are inferred.\", \"Do not reproduce bone openings as holes in living flesh.\", \"Folded pose height/length are artistic proportions, not measured holotype;4.5m is unfolded span reference.\"] {\"unfolded_wingspan_m\": 4.5, \"basis\": \"Andres/Langston2021 p47 and diagnosis; species estimate not pose bounding-box width. Reject mixing10m Q.northropi or18–20ft press number.\", \"constructed_extended_wing_path_m\": 4.480847806543123, \"constructed_path_note\": \"Approximate straightened sum of shoulder-to-wrist plus single fourth-finger control-path lengths and 0.28 m shoulder spacing. Close to 4.5 m reference, not a fossil measurement or folded bounding box.\"}"
  },
